"Bring WP Job Manager into BuddyPress profiles — members post jobs, manage "
"resumes, and apply, all from their profile."
msgstr ""
"Traga WP Job Manager para perfis BuddyPress — membros postam empregos, "
"gerenciam currículos e se candidatam, tudo a partir de seu perfil."

